# Allowlist build context. Everything is excluded unless re-included below,
# so agent memory (.runtime/), research data, secrets, and local config can
# never leak into an image layer.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!LICENSE.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!crates
crates/**/target
# Committed, secret-free example configs only: the builder's server tests
# parse them. Local config/agent.toml and config/steve.toml stay excluded.
!config/agent.example.toml
!config/agent.isolated.toml
!config/examples/steve/agent.toml
!config/examples/steve/steve.toml
